<title>BRAZIL: Telebras says Q1 results due out today.</title>
<headline>Telebras says Q1 results due out today.</headline>
<dateline>BRASILIA 1997-05-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>First quarter results for Brazilian federal telecommunications giant Telebras will be released tonight, officials said.</p>
<p>&quot;It should be coming out tonight, but not before 6:00 p.m.,&quot; said a spokesman for the company.</p>
<p>He said the results are slated to be released to local stock exchanges at 1800 local time/1700 EDT.</p>
<p>Telebras is the benchmark blue chip on the local stock markets and trades in New York as a Level Three American Depositary Receipt (ADR).</p>
<p>(( -- James Craig, Brasilia newsroom 5561 2230358))</p>
